From ea19d694666d3867132c4c0e24dfe2c6e493734c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:35:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: equip upgrades + choose quest rewards; verdict skips
 event/scripted/superseded; ender guard (F-219)

- gear_up(): wear every usable bag item (class, level, armour type, starting weapon skills) that
  beats what is in its slot (class-weighted stats + armour + weapon DPS; a two-hander vs main+off);
  runs after every turn-in. Northshire's level-6 warrior still wore its starting kit with a belt,
  cloak, trousers and boots in the bag
- pick_reward(): the biggest usable upgrade among RewardChoiceItemIDs, else the best seller
- verdict: superseded (RewardNextQuest done/taken - AC refuses the earlier quest), event-only
  givers (game_event_creature) and scripted Special-quest givers are listed, not counted
- hand-ins only for quests whose ender is in the area (9704's KeyError ended Sunstrider's run)

Queued for the next fleet restart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
